{
  "_comment": [
    "Shared credential-scrub fixtures for cluster-update-fr (Go) and derio-net/frank scripts/life_scrub.py.",
    "This repository is PUBLIC, so no fixture is stored as a literal token: each `in` is a list of",
    "segments joined in order. A segment is a string, {\"repeat\": s, \"times\": n}, or {\"base64\": s}",
    "(standard encoding of s). `kinds` lists every kind that must be reported and redacted to",
    "«redacted:<kind>»; `leaks` lists literal substrings of the input that must not survive (in addition to every repeat/base64 segment of 16+ chars). `benign` inputs must come back",
    "byte-identical."
  ],
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "installation token",
      "kinds": [
        "github-token"
      ],
      "in": [
        "auth ",
        "gh",
        "s_",
        {
          "repeat": "A1b2",
          "times": 9
        },
        " ok"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "classic pat",
      "kinds": [
        "github-token"
      ],
      "in": [
        "gh",
        "p_",
        {
          "repeat": "Zz09",
          "times": 9
        }
      ]
    },
    {
